kaolin_rkpm.py
--------------
Contains code from NVIDIA Kaolin (https://github.com/NVIDIAGameWorks/kaolin), master branch,
2026:

  - kaolin/physics/simplicits/skinning/rkpm.py (SimplicitsRKPM, RKPM)
  - kaolin/physics/simplicits/network.py (SkinningModule's bounding-box normalisation)
  - kaolin/physics/materials/material_utils.py (to_lame)

