Modified by the Hexapod project (2026-10-02): ported from PyTorch to NumPy/SciPy (CPU),
eigenproblem solved with scipy.linalg.eigh instead of torch.lobpcg, a jitter on the mass
matrix and a ridge on the RKPM moment matrix for thin and flat shapes, deterministic NumPy
farthest point sampling, chunked evaluation. The modifications are listed at the top of the
file.
